              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama mtu yeyote hatasikiliza maneno yangu ambayo huyo nabii atayasema kwa Jina langu, mimi mwenyewe nitamwajibisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
