              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini nabii ambaye atathubutu kusema kwa Jina langu kitu chochote ambacho sikumwamuru akiseme, au nabii ambaye husema kwa jina la miungu mingine ni lazima auawe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
